        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nuusta ashoohoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Dawdi ak ghabeawa hoowa ak gamng'awsa gwaleeda Adulamu; iimuchu nea ghwayiiy orjooga ghaamwat ea gheanyaawa sean ng'asheesu, gaweay headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giliwas sih mideawa sawanadeeda, ea giliwas sih mideawa siileeda, ea buuneesean sawana gurooruunatka nyaawa, gabassa geat headaanyi; ak ghoah shirikarajeanda haw ambal saawa. Nea fuga mideayi sea niny ghwahita fih bughalaji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabeawa Dawdi hoowa ak gawa Mispayda Moabu; ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda Moabu, “Geamuscheey goobiida bwaabwa ea iyya headaang'u, bwak ea danal gida jea gwasinnean ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanung'usiinyi saawa sea sugoocheanda Moabu, ak gwandeayi sea niny damanda sean mideewa jeeda gwaleeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda sibaneeda siguura Gadi ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Adiibiidi jeeda gwaleeda; ng'eada ak guwi jeeda ng'eanyiida Yuda.” Hean ghang'eat Dawdi ak gawa, jeeda dareabeeta Hereti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghwayiiy Sawli gideaba sinyas Dawdi sea fuga mideawa. Abeeda Sawli gwanda Gibeya, aba guumda ghuyeanda mida uhuuda heayeeda, nea gwanda geatindaanyi ng'uta, nea ghamiinaada fugaaschi sean aba murdeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda miinaada aba murdeadaanyi, “Asi ghamneawa oaleaydiit, agoogeeda was fuga Benjamini, neada orjeeda Yese gayghoadaw giliwas sih madamnyeanda ea madameega sabiibu, gayghwanung' ahuwa oagasean shirikareeda hees ambal fuga nyiit sagalamnyoojiga ea gea bughalajeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea eeyi bwak ea agasa oogasean gideaba gajalaabwan bwadawi? Manda siida nirukunean gideaba orjeedeanyu niduupchi geaw sea orjeeda Yese, ak ea manda siida wassean nigiisan aba badaydeanyu ghana gwarugu gideaba orjeedeanyu nifoolan fugeasu bea gadiyeeda ghwastan, nea ghwaradaanan gawuurji gideaba ghamneawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha Doegi was siida Edomu, miinaada aba murdeeda fuga gadiyeeda Sawli, ak gwayeesha, “Aniini naadaayi orjeeda Yese nea ghwaan Nobu heeda Ahimeleki orjeeda Ahitubu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gamus NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydaanyi, ak ghoadaw hamichoojiga, ak ghoadaw ng'uta Goliyati was siida Filisti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta sugoocheanda siida gaguursa Ahimeleki was ashoohoocheanda, was orjeeda Ahitubu, sea fuga gheanyaawa, was ashoohoodiga mida Nobu; ak ghapka fugiga seaniin heeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Sawli, “Aleaydiit ghamneawa, orjeeda Ahitubu.” Ak ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Aniini geandi hiji, ng'utamiideanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha niny, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i inyas giilaapchaan bwadaw ang'iing'i sea orjeeda Yese, ak giidawi niny mukaate ea ng'uta, ak goomuschi ASEETA aba badaydaanyi, ak ea niyamsean geaw, ak ghwaradaanan ea ghoah ghamneawa nea gagasa nuusteanyu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Ahimeleki ghuuta sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Ak gajea ng'eaha aba jeeda fugaagu sean bea gadiyeeda dea doabiiwaat ea gawuurji Dawdi, was orjeeda agweaji sugoocheanda, ak ea shirikarajeanda haw ambal siidaang'u furnyi, ak geawal gheang'da aba jeedeaba gheang'u? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ea eaweeda madeeda eamuschi ASEETA aba badaydaanyi? Manda! Gidabal ea marukunana sugoocheanda gida wassean badayda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda ghana heeda fuga ghaheanya; aba gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda manda gida nal aba ng'asheesu seaniin, aasaang'a ghana ea ng'ay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Aba huumwa gaymeawa, Ahimeleki, ang'iing'i sea fugeaba gheang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha sugoocheanda furiischoocheanda miinaada aba murdeadaanyi, “Yamwa geaw ak gibwari ashoohoodiga NG'UTAMIIDA; aba gideaba niguuyi geatinga sea Dawdi, nea ghwanal gideaba nimng'aw, ak ea marukunean.” Iidu fuga gadiyeeda sugoocheanda ea mwayiina geatinga nyaawa ghabwar ashoohoodiga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda Doegi, “Asi yamwa geaw ak gibwari ashoohoodiga.” Hean ghang'eat Doegi bea eemeeda Edomu ak ghabwar ashoohoodiga, ak ghabwar eaweedida fih seedam ea muut rassa hamarjoojiga nyaawa hang'weaka bumbuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar Nobu mujiineeda ashoohoodiga aba ng'uta; headiga sean ea gadeemga ea diibiga ea gea reer ea heewga, ea digeeniga ea gisilga ak ghabwar aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gamng'aw orjeanagi bea Ahimeleki was orjeeda Ahitubu, siguura Abiyatari ak gamaseaw Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa Abiyatari Dawdi gideaba nibwar Sawli ashoohoodiga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Abiyatari, “Aniini ghaanali gideaba Doegiheeda eemeeda Edomu gwanda hoowa eaweedida, ak aba huumwa gaygwarukusa Sawli. Gideaba naanung' ghwanyas fuga ghaheang'wa miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi apteada eendeayeena, adibeali; aba gideaba siida gasa eaweegeasu gagasa eaweagaagu; iisindeayi gaybeaha seayu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
